      "alt": "TQMa53 Embedded Cortex®-A53 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX53 unites industry and multimedia</h1>\n<p>The TQMa53 is an embedded Cortex®-A53 module based on the i.MX53 processor, offering a unique fusion of industrial and multimedia capabilities. It features an Arm® Cortex®-A8 core with a clock rate of up to 1.2 GHz and low power consumption (typ. 3 W), making it suitable for a wide range of applications. This module is well-equipped with IEEE 1588 support, security functions, and e-MMC Flash storage for data reliability. With integrated graphic support for up to UXGA resolution, it's ideal for HMI, animated displays, and multitouch applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:16:52 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
